# Local data and generated artifacts.
#
# Anchored with ** rather than at the root: a pattern with a slash in it is
# relative to this file, so `data/*.db` matched nothing under
# `packages/server/data/` and a running server's world database was being
# committed with everything else.
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-shm
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/snapshots/
artifacts/
.env
.env.local
